Version: 1.0.0 (Production / Government-Ready)
Target Platforms: Desktop Web, Tablet, Mobile Web (Responsive First)
1. Design Philosophy & Aesthetic Identity
The visual identity merges the institutional authority of a sovereign constitution with the operational velocity of high-performance developer tools (e.g., Linear, GitHub, Stripe Press).
Institutional Gravitas: Avoids cheap corporate SaaS gradients. Employs deep sovereign greens, architectural slates, crisp bone-white backgrounds, and warm bronze/gold accents.
Radical Clarity & Legibility: Optimized for high-friction policy reading, structured comparative tables, and multi-tier debates.
Dual-Language Native: Seamless horizontal and vertical balance across English and Bangla (বাংলা).
